  era: "Section 37 \xB7 Society \xB7 Across the ages"
  title: Caste system
  text: Caste combines the four varnas with thousands of jatis, often linked to occupation and marriage within the group. Reformers and Dr B. R. Ambedkar fought caste discrimination; the Constitution abolished untouchability in Article 17 and provided reservations.
